<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0327_R03PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh my!\nThere wasn’t NOTHIN’ built here when I\fclimbed this mountain in ’72.\rThings change. Everything get more and\nmore convenient. And expensive.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0327_R03PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MAD Hustlers visit the mountain. You\nnever know what homies you gon’ run\finto. Heal your homies here. Seriously.\fAnd save your progress! Trust me!\fI didn’t. I’m still mad.\n</language>
	</row>
</body>
